<section class="sec sec-paper" aria-labelledby="gap-h">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="statement reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow">The gap we exist to close</span>
      <h2 class="sec-title" id="gap-h">Finishing treatment is the beginning, <em>not the end</em>.</h2>
      <p>A woman completes 30, 60, or 90 days of treatment. She has done the hardest thing she will ever do. Then the program ends, and she is discharged to whatever housing she can find that week.</p>
      <p>Often that means a shelter, a couch, a car, or the same house she was using in. The structure that held her together for three months disappears in a single afternoon.</p>
      <blockquote class="pullquote">Relapse after treatment is not usually a failure of willpower. It is a failure of housing.</blockquote>
      <p>A woman cannot hold a job without an address. She cannot keep appointments without a ride. She cannot rebuild her finances while she is working out where to sleep tonight.</p>
      <p><strong>Oasis Women Center exists for the twelve to twenty-four months after treatment ends</strong>, when stability is fragile and the right support changes the entire outcome.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sec sec-ink2" aria-labelledby="house-h">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="campaign">
      <div class="campaign-visual reveal">
        <figure class="figure">
          <img src="/assets/images/photos/house-exterior-wide.webp" alt="A four bedroom single story family home in daylight, the kind of house Oasis is working toward." width="1536" height="1024" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
        </figure>
        <div class="progress-card">
          <h4>{{ home.progress_label }}</h4>
          <div class="bar"><div class="bar-fill" data-pct="{{ home.progress_percent }}" role="progressbar" aria-valuenow="{{ home.progress_percent }}" aria-valuemin="0" aria-valuemax="100" aria-label="Progress toward opening the first home"></div></div>
          <div class="progress-meta">
            <strong>{{ home.progress_status }}</strong>
            <span>{{ home.progress_note }}</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="reveal d2">
        <span class="eyebrow">Our north star</span>
        <h2 class="sec-title" id="house-h">The house we are <em>working toward</em>.</h2>
        <p class="sec-lead" style="margin-bottom:14px;">Four bedrooms. Eight women at a time. A two year lease, a kitchen table, and a door that locks.</p>

        <ul class="milestones">
          {%- for m in home.milestones %}
          <li>
            <span class="dot {{ m.state }}" aria-hidden="true">{% if m.state == 'done' %}&#10003;{% elif m.state == 'now' %}&bull;{% else %}&nbsp;{% endif %}</span>
            <span class="ms-t"><strong>{{ m.title }}</strong><span>{{ m.detail }}</span></span>
          </li>
          {%- endfor %}
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="stats reveal" style="margin-top:84px;">
      {%- for st in home.stats %}
      <div class="stat">
        <div class="stat-n">{{ st.number }}</div>
        <div class="stat-l">{{ st.label }}</div>
      </div>
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>

    <p class="note reveal" style="margin-top:44px;">{{ home.disclosure }}</p>
  </div>
</section>

