          <div class="pillar-body">
            <span class="pillar-num" aria-hidden="true">01</span>
            <h3>Transitional Housing</h3>
            <p>Safe, sober housing with case management, life skills coaching, and support groups, plus direct help finding work and permanent housing.</p>
          </div>
          <figure class="pillar-figure">
            <img src="/assets/images/photos/room-morning-day.webp" alt="A bedroom in bright morning light with a neatly made bed and a lamp and Bible on the nightstand." width="1536" height="1024" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
