            <p>Bus passes, ride share vouchers, gas cards, and volunteer drivers, so work, court, treatment, and childcare stay reachable.</p>
          </div>
          <figure class="pillar-figure">
            <img src="/assets/images/photos/road-day.webp" alt="A quiet tree-lined residential street in bright morning daylight, the route to work." width="1536" height="1024" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
