</section>


<section class="sec sec-white" id="founder" aria-labelledby="founder-h">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="split">
      <div class="split-body reveal">
        <span class="eyebrow">Meet the founder</span>
        <h2 class="sec-title" id="founder-h">Twenty years ago, I had no address. <em>But Jesus knew where to find me.</em></h2>

        <p class="founder-name">Keisha Ortiz</p>
        <p class="founder-role">Founder and Board Chair &nbsp;&bull;&nbsp; Denton County, Texas</p>

        <p>Keisha founded Oasis out of the season she lived herself. Twenty years ago she was homeless with a five-month-old son, until a transitional home on Ross Avenue in Dallas took her family in. There was a workforce center where she could look for a job, childcare where her son took his first steps, and volunteers who sat down and built a budget with her.</p>

        <p>Today she serves on the board of directors of that same facility.</p>

        <p>Four years of volunteering with a discipleship program for people in recovery brought it full circle. A resident asked her what would happen when the program ended. Where would she go? How would she get to work? Keisha recognized the questions. She had asked them herself. <strong>In June 2024, Oasis Women Center was born.</strong></p>

        <p style="margin-top:32px;">
          <a class="btn btn-outline-ink" href="/founder/">Read Keisha's story</a>
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="split-visual reveal d2">
        {# FOUNDER VIDEO SLOT: when Keisha's 90-second video arrives, it replaces this figure. #}
        <figure class="figure portrait">
          <img src="/assets/images/photos/keisha-ortiz.webp" alt="Keisha Ortiz, founder of Oasis Women Center, seated in a living room in warm natural light." width="1000" height="1250" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
          <figcaption class="figure-tag">Keisha Ortiz, Founder</figcaption>
        </figure>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

